		<ul id="e02424">
			<li>
				<p>When the vehicle is in <term translate="no">POWER ON</term> position, Select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Lights</uicontrol><uicontrol>Ambient lighting</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system to enable or adjust the ambient light function.</p>
			</li>
